{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1297,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd01f5271dde475b40d320d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽全力，取胜啊啊啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8c2988b4c5e755fbb9a5213af5c21ff1a8c75e52345d9c1f6a71dfe2ea302e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0617d15cb82455b199a29dca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えへへ…。\r\nたまにはバチっと決めちゃうよー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4bf4d68ec1be443194ea6496f49d140e71902b2283b4c0797db02e48e8251e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0fa7196b77ae3b02b2aa192",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わっ！なになに？\r\nもしかしてリボン、曲がってる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b08cdbbe09e58ff7276a34593eeb11d11bc03f2ffe72a07a24f84b759ee0f657",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3258242eabd57c4b496512",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0581a1170e98882d9e93e6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好──！我不会输哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aca32d36b42ccb8e306041f7fac734cf286bd8205bcb0e23b044fd97d0582ebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b1a3d80164974482c532a38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还能继续！\r\n用尽全力去碰撞吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7167f3105b248dae262a878102237fb6b8d1f6f56a68d3e1cbc1097238936273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf0e5edcf1c4055c3fedc6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊──训练员！！\r\n今天也要整天充满活力！然后……\r\n呃……充满活力地努力！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58294741906b00a89593ce3578f29c95ce28b6bdac7a1b5003d71c3b244ee45f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39988aa632db4ec9a1732288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚看到大鸟带着小鸟在飞……\r\n呜……大家一早就很努力地\r\n活着呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2a9fe1b2759e55eb236d2b6f2f1d6f6383351b5440e09ec37d8d3e25511ed3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e40464a4bac5795a9ae49795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜喔喔喔！呜喔喔喔喔────！\r\n我绝对不会输给\r\n吃完午餐的睡意的──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e51c22729b8e90cbb5c891e19605482f7323d77727b7cc4af258a9b6ffdcef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e253adcc530b5dcaa3994d8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安，训练员！\r\n现在是午后训练的时间了吧！\r\n太好啦──！我等好久了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b79c2706a14b36e6528e09d86c722f8fe6f36c245681cb4a9563359ee76b2ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6205794d7b30b9635b2883b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜……又忙到这么晚，\r\n训练员真是努力呢……\r\n谢谢你为了我这么辛苦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dacfdfe4c4e57c58b3219b9505cf8a3b40eef455a7691c0fa5911dd8462a270",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:980ca8bd3dc02c9081c3a469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么──！？已经晚上了──！？\r\n我完全还没有跑够哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b346f9aa5a153685e80d30802739d2d711958a986b886ccb14b709e64599f68e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e42bd066d5863e2afda685cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛开的樱花、相遇与离别……！\r\n春天就是这样充满感伤与感动，\r\n……我好喜欢啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33be870db892a1f6e79db2906281193884e783804e423c712d05c51603bdab43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bc4ae207e41cc1624dd43f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很热吗？那我们去游泳池吧！\r\n前空翻跳进水里超舒服的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a8ede03649c4ffd5d9b8982402300207f160ef58cc12453078867249aea9472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b320b29a34f2b308f2affb94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜……落叶真的很了不起……\r\n直到生命的最后都那么美丽，\r\n……我也要努力地活着啊～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12ae516a65336542672a4677fb5228fe7983dcc06988463a07169406914e5d4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d1665f1b85ac334cfd2bbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和小雪约好要一起做雪屋哦！\r\n等做好了要约朋友们来呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fda3c9eed97e54d808c16b76caac45c894ff559c79776de4efb879bbb776a444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935254b95d8c13fed84fafd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早、安、啊────！！\r\n耶嘿，看你满脸睡意，\r\n所以来为你提振精神啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "304c0ff34501c8babc22c077c67f7479db841819b5ee527edaca7c9fa6ea0094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b7ae76a20078e471375f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你明明这么努力工作……\r\n我却总是忍不住出手打你……\r\n闹钟，真是对不起啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1513feb7d0cd7e3adb7c9dd947a87fbddc787b43dc5bb505448474c8358a318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce80ffe29ca648916202a087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在游戏中担任送货员时\r\n有帮忙送过午餐喔！\r\n下次来试试看外送打工好了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c26a3446b9580f1f45df8369cc1f4f83aef04e7f8a8bff003b2086e6f24bb795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb37d6ff6d0b58634a40ff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很无聊？那一起来跑酷吧！\r\n别担心，只要灵活扭动身体\r\n就行了，很简单的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6143ca8d9770496f61811cfa4298b49f380e3ba6f5a575efa5a6aca50abaa604",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a252824dde81e815a5db030a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呜……我把作业本忘在教室了……\r\n呜哇啊啊啊啊！有没有人能\r\n把作业本送来给我啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d6167d9dfad86566f60f657b475119747f4f7af287e728a61a2b113c5d00bac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54d7b628113d509a30aa21a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听晨光说最好避免在晚上写信，\r\n就试着在晚上写写看……结果写出\r\nBNW是三色面包……天啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "471a6dd80a9af26b99969b59e4e3e0fc255b15273f4ddcb440934a59707e2c7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d87963ae0b723c132cdabb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天就想到开学典礼！！\r\n新生们眼中都闪闪发光！\r\n充满了梦想，真是可爱呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "373ee48cc195dc907d191810d5ab70c40dfca821a3e747505ea0a6c015790624",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea21d8786c032a1e8f7cdffc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热啊～！真想去凉爽的地方……\r\n对了！用VR赛马娘仿真器\r\n上雪山好了！也约小雪一起去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54199b3a60baf7270bf15981de86ec71bed98a682972481c7b64cd771eea9e81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:530572ca1fb1292cd1d457f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟大进聊起想去捡栗子！\r\n然后她就告诉我一款\r\n收集栗子的益智游戏～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9147913739b8d7746d435bff364a5693772a33aa697df0e864cd24d89b6d8dfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9c080934a225ca0134a29e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次我去滑雪时成功使出超帅气的\r\n空中特技！多亏我事前用\r\nVR赛马娘仿真器好好练习过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c69f7b48ee6b10f925cc066c5c74c68a89a8df8b5eb38611ecedc1c832261831",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62bd5f296f3eddd11297fe8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a8485ab44b16beccfc2e373",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4e3409843f64b13605b70e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝だよ！起きて！おっはよーー！！\r\n…どう？今度出す目覚ましボイス！\r\n声が通るからって頼まれたんだ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e17c6b087af5284de1c3791e77609a8c0386dcdba54383860cdd48d0c759961",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d602f547a287867b00ad4d38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どれーなーざん、やっどぎだぁ～！\r\n夢みだいにっ、ごないどおも…！\r\nひっぐ！ずっど一緒にいでねぇぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66db8d4ab34b41e8a89a395e70ccb982bece3a76824ba33ab7a37a4084ee188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75847d815294d8eaa5090e0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウイニングチケットが\r\nお昼を宣誓しまぁぁぁぁぁす！\r\n…あれ？宣言だっけ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ad466a9a7b7ec61f2047ab3a907218a80b2aea30bf39eb19a4ce3f5c45b1868",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41693204ecd45843aedd50b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午後もビシッ！とがんばろー！\r\n…あ！お腹鳴っちゃった！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c48c895d7ea7db7f21d6e3e32ede514ef7120b41fdd63234e23e844cf65476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1143df2db02eaede96f1e95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、無理しないでね！\r\n高パフォーマンスには22時就寝！\r\nって、エルフィーさん言ってたよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "589ee0bc59889d9be76d4333f67856b06536ce2bb64bd929dda4db7965a3fe9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a9d5a62bfc9e0624f8621c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あっ！起きちゃったーー！！\r\nぬーん。ドラマみたいに上着、\r\nそっとかけようと思ったのに～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "951b7c867437a70468b54efe134d78f18085111cc299c9f195c9594ec555057c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05df8e0b4c145db0579f15d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ、毛虫！\r\n…ハヤヒデがビックリする前に、\r\nどこかへ逃がしに行こーっと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dd43c65a56312cd80b9e5efc693f63ba819aa0992798cb8faf8b35b39737df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829ccf08a14c16e4548545be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏！到！来！だー！\r\nトレーナーさん！マリンスポーツ！\r\nマリンスポーツしよー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69dfe847df6e1be0d0c5d9f5d3033974625c6d55af3d8bbfbac709417bbc49d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62370024452f7673eccbf1fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねえねえ！次の聖蹄祭でさ、\r\n一緒にマジックショーしよっ！\r\n一緒に耳、おっきくしよーー！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "803ed1d1ac00929fc8d38a5884f0e745aed36d93359c88f0bc715b93b90a0716",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dee6728e6c1d2f595ec992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、寒くない？\r\nアタシの手袋、片っぽあげるよ！\r\n大きさ合うかな～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a1d0bb84ce2da2c56ed8b7101a9c7af106d10a91ba59beca7a96b4fa7287e0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22149880839a37112173d21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d8d9eca19623907ad62c3fee5b746e2a7886cd999191715aceca42bf64b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df843bc0f1637c991a9861df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把我的点心分给你──！\r\n应该是放在口袋里没错……\r\n奇怪？怎么会？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd29b4911581a9a2e820c9daace3b8216025bb781653ec2d09c650017bc7f1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb422f50d8f1a5ff9f0b734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次补考都会找晨光教我学习，\r\n但她还是每次都很有耐心、\r\n很严格地教我……真的人好好喔喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17d7a62de9e3e03475962389cc68bb43e75dbb89b93ae704c8b852ef6fd07d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9468f98f2274bad7c77acdbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被拜托当比赛的救援时，\r\n就会比平常更有干劲哦！\r\n因为想要达到大家的期望嘛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cc9dc3d7447fc55efbdddba1b8751353846e8cb4fdf7fb971785af41e5fcfb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a30297e4b6815da1290b092f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精神皆要健全！\r\n爸──！我没有忘记\r\n运动员的精神哦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7a13283f160804b874c8232e9026a0f0e548351058acee63c8dc63462abb10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40516f3bd92a268dac51023d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哎呀？我好像想起了\r\n什么事情……又忘记了！\r\n应该不重要吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d79fb8f9d62075c5ff3d46155f696f7e7d92d6c8381ae8bd5373bcfb3b3f2a71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a74884fcd13f300173503e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是跑步还是在舞台上表演，\r\n只要能通过我的脚带给大家感动，\r\n那我就会感到非常开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb1f810495591d58a6f3e8d39897f06fafcdf75bc217b1b6dc21452719d5c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56370269338a0da62fdb8a03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……直挺挺！\r\n嘿嘿，怎么样怎么样？\r\n我有像大家一样把衣服穿好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f1e57417bee4a9891f5b20662fde0218ddb894f8ceed8ce0a6a4c87bfca328d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85cd49de686c27377bde9c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要瞬间看到了机会，\r\n我就会奋力向前冲！\r\n这就是比赛的精髓！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4485aec97577ed801a83894a4409eba19f3b5575ca1f59ab26ca742a50ce48f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:129b210b2df972a1919df56e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个胜利的图案是我小时候想的。\r\n哼哼──！很有品味吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae3bcb8a4ad850fd8897d665c9c5ec034e0a6f32789afb4a3dac4a322c38916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b833423f64c06111f02cb480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "佐敦总是很早起哦！\r\n还会很用心化妆……呜喔喔！\r\n那么努力真的很了不起──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d4bb27afa12326ca8051f9fc630d8a58138e1e043cd222d1518b936cebd836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719038f543e18933ee8416e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午的饭粒粘在衣服上，\r\n害我被后辈笑了啦！\r\n好丢脸哦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb53f89a5f57f9076dc7c8342bd9cd7ea6bfea06866cf999a574f246e880ab4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33db9b6be4ed755203213182",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よぉぉし！負けないぞぉ～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb964a4338e2d357b83c9ad3ff18d2e5466934a1215a1069f4e9187561b18d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eebe960871ab3b219b8b7d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……晚上了啊。如、如果有鬼出现\r\n我一定要跟他说……！\r\n不准让大家害怕──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f4dac0c4f41c29a511707cfffc46d989bd88ee13836dc2ab61a44b3ab2c79c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e7a4c7f2e03f801f2cec2d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为发现了德比特辑的杂志，\r\n害我花光了钱包里的钱！\r\n……又得向妈妈谢罪了啦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "101c36b05905e2b5bc318e53371492b98d83360ae27ce845cea73c9fbb67046a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be3e725e56310d5c820e4981",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上遇到了大进，\r\n她今天不是只说我「吵死了」，\r\n还有回我「早安」哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9cd1e1f37df74e55e5f80016efa56add3ce18a5d3432bcc82753ed64d2cbdb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1153f920b4e5f3eef37ff63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节在山上跑步很愉快哦，\r\n不只景色很漂亮，还有看起来\r\n很好吃的红色蘑菇可以摘呢──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e016ad55bc0420903686e36372062baaf385200fe4a91ebc51a3dc8c23f2e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377870030836bf8659537024",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等一下我们来喝热可可吧！\r\n以前我妈妈常常帮我准备哦！\r\n说那是努力的奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0fe2a9ae81bfcf5206d9c25931f0d70c7e188eed0b1b16e5a82e2b9c900596",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c8f19e7b9f23b514e0f2466",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道动力飞行伞吗？\r\n以前我有跟爸爸一起玩过喔！\r\n操纵方式有点像在开飞机！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc7fe71a62fba99999c2ce51bc9f652e1f155a3a691a78c5fd9a4ee117143fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6811f3ffc99103af1b89f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个小包包？里面装着送货员名片！\r\n我给了涡轮一张，结果收到她亲手\r\n写的书法当回礼！她的字好漂亮～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e56dd2525170bfdf4c93bfe248b6c7a9a06064b18c615f003455ddd5975e5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8a3435326297d7a2cb7cc66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向正在游戏中修理机械的\r\n大进搭话，但她没有理我。\r\n她的专注力真的很强呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "748ef8dc103cf18a29660fed32c2df8476c51a31852a0244314be4ba0fd10345",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b196cf2bae93b91106957eef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听不太懂游戏说明……\r\n不过遇到什么疑惑\r\n晨光都会教我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7c544569910bc72a27f0f7b086c4f74389c2a052e4368c205828dea2c828e3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29a06b2454acb3a918d14d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好久没穿这种轻飘飘的衣服啦！\r\n以前我常穿姐姐的旧衣服，\r\n里面不少这种款式呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b171e38f0f9d8a9e7a6f69aa70548d1d965bdb66950e8af10d682b8ad0b09a1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70f14fb426759867c08eb077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上真是神清气爽呢～！\r\n害我从宿舍走到校舍时，忍不住用\r\n后空翻和侧翻跳过路上所有障碍物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "863d78f982d47be2d5e247e7c7a1a7a9fdc90a6b83c102b748225e5926342a61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e34079dd9c0901b495077973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔喔喔喔喔喔喔！唔喔喔喔！\r\n这时间很容易想睡，\r\n所以我在大声吶喊防止自己睡着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d15d5db932d699cf538ca98591fb4562140b8f16d4cdefec9a40f5dd6e841f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff20418b4dad551d4fed851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开着飞机不断飞高，\r\n是不是就能飞到星星上呢！\r\n……咦？你说……那是火箭才对？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f3935250cad5a3c75e9c0c83e625f1879e71d3f04eb58cc25249642676ea0b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5846ce39822fc750e16d4e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得从空中赏花怎么样？\r\n我想一定会很美！\r\n赶快打开游戏试试看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b930ff1321a4716c7b48a195f8790dc1054b79a8fab7ba40e88775df48419167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e033ea67f9ff413142d591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然在这大热天里努力工作\r\n到发烫……别太勉强啊──！\r\n仪器们──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "052a48c55a96aa66991b4d4805f74d8144bc8329acc8948ecdb51d0ce511f36e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd094c3d72935ad44806e205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会吧！原来捡枫叶不是为了\r\n摘下枫叶炸成天妇罗来吃啊！\r\n真的假的～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88852ea659548f579d62b7d1a82e815eb34259a4b4de6fc50c908edfdd17caa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf89636e6942530f82459909",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？我完全不觉得冷喔！\r\n反倒还觉得有点热……哈啾！\r\n啊哈哈，有人在偷说我坏话──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e58ec9f1c5ca47ea7ee129143bfad99d7293b5af2ddf1d45ca3e74ed1ad9b204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02cde9604bddfb0a5bb47fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是传递心意的送货员！\r\n没有我到达不了的地方！\r\n要送货就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "413af8e3bade670c75482c25c048035d941ed650df70449d833e760a68007d59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:191087325935db544b4da9b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸，一起玩游戏嘛！我想跟\r\n训练员一起在机械城市中玩耍～！\r\n好不好嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b2568bf5fb737f096695f33249080159b12b14fe9da6dfcc5e068f45c57755",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f41a672b56a5602a591aae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タイシンがね、\r\n『白と色モノ一緒に回すな！』\r\nって…。洗濯、難しいよぉ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be5fe60ab3d9f79222c8972125aeed475bcd0c0d1fab8c8efc448adc577bb53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0a4a75ef1642e6e3745c40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えぇー！？ヒト用の体力テスト、\r\n鉄球投げないの！？鉄球じゃ投げ\r\nても10mいかない！？ええー！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da7475d6ae05d7806b19777b40e34e6808528d378c4d862c92624301bdd52dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24103186bb7c5fd6a7fe0e59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チケゾー的、着こなしポイントは…\r\n帽子とリボンのお花！！つけると\r\n背筋ピーンってなるんだ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44c5258233e22ef039c6c9086b5a2b1058855ae0100f8532011a8155a53da787",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:778e5c366b8d6801f1f06c66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんかね！どこかに帽子をかぶった\r\nカッコいいユニットがあるん\r\nだって！アタシも入れるかな～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2efa515a79877d6260dc8056a30ce9d2c073172d93b126c57325b5b8c382adaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2cb6997a2fc42d1007d0ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次の『U.A.F.』サッカーも\r\n楽しみだ！またゴールネット、破け\r\nちゃったりして…大迫力、期待大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32589912a24c5324eeca21a090fa560f58b6177eab12f6b2f1100cbb2d317553",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed97239f2748182f209107b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "髪、今日はジョーダンに\r\n結んでもらったからさ！\r\n夕方まで絶っっ対！ほどけないよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49748965eb166bea13147f0b2bc039926b4c9d640816e634ac21572f131e88c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1b99eadca2c319e8a2f1b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねむい…ねむ…くない…。\r\nねむ…ねむ…ね…ね…\r\n……ねむくなーーーい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc000069c4600581bbcf7dff334d2764fc11c7346ea8247f159c94d4ab25c07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862358e0189440ef23f70bb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ネイチャ、ゲートボール強すぎる\r\nよ～。…でも！おばあちゃんになっ\r\nてもできるし！いつか絶対勝ーつ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18e91dada6279d8df76e842370d86a4174afa623ecb450bc3ceed998d7622c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86257f94707f6c8933c8f722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すごがっだよぉ～偉がっだよぉ～！\r\n新入生ちゃんの挨拶、\r\nザイゴーだっだよぉ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22fafee4f34d86005da138115c0fcfab24f8d95b89785609d4661267258de940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd23c3fbd029d4e62c9b9a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぃ～、今日も暑いな～。\r\nズボンの後ろ、\r\n涼しい素材でよかった～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d6ad3fdb3fb16a4cb63ad245e68dffa24ec37422906a237dc72f8515f1732c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91225"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
